        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma Rwot doŋ mito tero Elia woko i polo ki lapiru, onoŋo Elia ki Elica gitye i wotgi nia ki i Gilgal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia owaco bot Elica ni, “Alegi ni koŋ ibed kany; pien Rwot otyeko cwala woko wa i Betel.” Ento Elica ogamo ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwo-ni, macalo in kikomi bene itye makwo-ni, an pe abibwoti.” Kit meno gucako wot wa i Betel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak lunebi ma yam gitye i Betel gucito bot Elica guwacce ni, “In mono iŋeyo ni tin Rwot bikwanyo rwodi ki boti ci tero woko?” En ogamo ni, “Iyo, aŋeyo lokke; doŋ Wuliŋ mot.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia owacce ni, “Elica, alegi ni koŋ ibed kany, pien Rwot otyeko cwala woko wa i Jeriko.” Elica ogamo ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwo-ni, dok macalo in bene kikomi it ye makwoni, an pe abibwoti.” Kit meno gubino wa i Jeriko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak lunebi ma gitye i Jeriko gubino bot Elica cok, guwacce ni, “In mono iŋeyo ni tin Rwot bi kwanyo rwodi ki boti ci tero woko?” En ogamo ni. “Iyo, aŋeyo lokke; doŋ Wuliŋ mot.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia dok owacce ni, “Alegi ni koŋ ibed kany; pien Rwot ocwala wa i Jordan.” En ogamo ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwo-ni, dok macalo in bene kikomi it ye makwo-ni, pe abibwoti.” Kit meno gin aryo ducu gumedde ki wot kacel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak lunebi pyerabic bene guwoto kacel kwedgi, ci gucuŋ ki cen ka mabor ki gin, ka pud gin aryo ducu gucuŋ i dog Jordan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia okwanyo boŋone kikome, odolo woko, ogoyo ki pii, ci pii iye opokke woko aryo tuŋŋi ki tuŋŋi nio ka gin aryo ducu gukato ki i nom mutwo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
